1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:01,901
I'm sorry.

2
00:00:01,901 --> 00:00:03,403
For saying these things
after turning you down.

3
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:04,871
It's okay.

4
00:00:04,871 --> 00:00:07,874
I'm just getting it off
my chest before I leave.

5
00:00:08,108 --> 00:00:09,175
You're leaving?

6
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:11,811
I'm thinking of quitting at
the end of this month.

7
00:00:12,045 --> 00:00:13,179
You're quitting?

8
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:14,114
Just like that?

9
00:00:14,114 --> 00:00:16,181
I finally have something
I want to do.

10
00:00:16,282 --> 00:00:19,285
Plus, I got a great offer.

11
00:00:21,421 --> 00:00:22,856
Huh? This is...

12
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:25,158
I got scouted, thanks to you.

13
00:00:26,426 --> 00:00:27,426
Congratulations!

14
00:00:27,927 --> 00:00:29,429
I thank you for everything.

15
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,431
Oh, right.

16
00:00:31,431 --> 00:00:32,999
This is yours.

17
00:00:33,566 --> 00:00:36,136
I'm sorry.
I'm the one who took it.

18
00:00:36,136 --> 00:00:37,704
I completely forgot
about this.

19
00:00:38,471 --> 00:00:40,106
I'm the one
that should apologize.

20
00:00:40,106 --> 00:00:42,008
I took it without permission.

21
00:00:42,008 --> 00:00:44,244
I was really
shocked at first.

22
00:00:44,244 --> 00:00:45,724
I thought you had
feelings for Eun-ho.

23
00:00:46,012 --> 00:00:47,012
For Eun-ho?

24
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,848
This is a picture of you.

25
00:00:48,848 --> 00:00:49,848
Me?

26
00:00:50,683 --> 00:00:52,852
See your profile here?

27
00:00:52,852 --> 00:00:53,852
It's so handsome.

28
00:00:56,589 --> 00:00:58,024
That's so unexpected.

29
00:00:58,358 --> 00:01:00,518
I thought there was something
going on between you two.

30
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,662
Eun-ho is just
like a little brother.

31
00:01:02,762 --> 00:01:04,230
I know.

32
00:01:04,497 --> 00:01:05,497
Speaking of which...

33
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:07,567
Did something happen
to Eun-ho?

34
00:01:07,967 --> 00:01:10,970
He left his phone and
something feels off about him.

35
00:01:11,604 --> 00:01:13,339
There might've been
some misunderstanding.

36
00:01:13,339 --> 00:01:14,808
Was there something
between you and me?

37
00:01:14,808 --> 00:01:15,808
I don't understand.

38
00:01:18,578 --> 00:01:19,579
Boss?

39
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,380
Hye-won.

40
00:01:21,714 --> 00:01:22,714
You have to help me.
